cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use PhyloBot 2 in published work, please cite the PhyloBot paper below,
  together with the methods your analysis used (listed in the README under
  "Included methods").
title: PhyloBot 2
abstract: >-
  Automated ancestral sequence reconstruction (alignment, phylogeny, ASR) and
  interactive exploration of the mutational paths between ancestral proteins.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hanson-Smith
    given-names: Victor
    email: hello@phylobot.com
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: https://github.com/headwatersdiscovery/phylobot2
url: https://phylobot.com
keywords:
  - ancestral sequence reconstruction
  - phylogenetics
  - protein evolution
  - Nextflow
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    PhyloBot: A Web Portal for Automated Phylogenetics, Ancestral Sequence
    Reconstruction, and Exploration of Mutational Trajectories
  authors:
    - family-names: Hanson-Smith
      given-names: Victor
    - family-names: Johnson
      given-names: Alexander
  journal: PLoS Computational Biology
  volume: 12
  issue: 7
  start: e1004976
  year: 2016
  month: 7
  doi: 10.1371/journal.pcbi.1004976
